# Gradle build output for the ffs-notify Android library.
#
# Same reasoning as modules/ffs-ble/android/.gitignore: the root .gitignore's `/android`
# entry is anchored to the repo root (the generated app project) and does NOT cover a
# module's own build dir. And on this box, Gradle's deeply nested .transforms/ artifacts
# blow past Windows MAX_PATH — `git add` then fails with "Filename too long" and aborts
# the WHOLE staging operation, not just that file.
build/
.cxx/
